  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Which expression is equivalent to&nbsp;<math alttext=\"StartFraction 42 a Over k EndFraction plus 42 a k\"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mn>42</mn></mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>42</mn></mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>k</mi></math>, where&nbsp;<math alttext=\"k greater than 0\"><mi>k</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>?</p>",
